  "claim_short": "Stephen Simons arXiv 2407.00479 Faces of quasidensity Remark 11.4 conjecture whether G_M equals F_M on B* for every CMQd set. Full one-dimensional counterexample: E=R and M_lambda={(s,lambda s)} for lambda>0 is closed monotone quasidense. Exact formulas P_M(u,v)=(v-lambda u)^2/(4lambda), G_M(y,z)=(y-lambda z)^2/(4lambda), while F_M(y,z)=0 on y=lambda z and +infinity otherwise. Thus for lambda=1 at (0,1), G_M=1/4...",
